1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
Ang ika-6 naming anibersaryo.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:03,340
Tae-jun...?

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,780
Hindi ka dapat nandito.

4
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:10,030
Anibersaryo natin ngayon.

5
00:00:10,330 --> 00:00:11,220
Dati 'yon.

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,930
Hinaan mo ang boses mo. Usapang pamilya ito.

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,800
Ma... alam n'yo?

8
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,880
Ako ang nag-ayos nito.

9
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,870
Anim na taon. Walang tagapagmana.

10
00:00:27,170 --> 00:00:30,240
Ang babaeng 'yan ang papalit sa'yo.

11
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,590
Sino siya?

12
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,830
Humarap ka. Ipakita mo sa kanya.

13
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,940
Hindi mo ba ako nakikilala, ate?

14
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:44,710
Kambal mo ako.

15
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:51,500
EP.2 — Buntis siya sa anak niya. Team Seo-yoon o Team Chae-rin?
